# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, whatever the platform, so a diff shows only real
# changes (a CRLF checkout on Windows used to make whole files look rewritten).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Bytes that must never be converted: images, signed .wol fixtures, fuzz seeds, patches applied to
# other trees, and vendored crates (their checksums cover the exact bytes).
*.png binary
*.wol binary
*.patch -text
fuzz/regressions/** -text
third_party/** -text
